# C2P+ adaptive confirmation depth.  First candidate always probes; later
# ordinal 2--4 probes use a 64-entry PC-hash x ordinal 3-bit utility score.
# Hit +2 / miss -1 and threshold 4 encode a roughly one-third break-even hit
# probability.  A forced continuation every 64 opportunities prevents a cold
# or unlucky PC bucket from being permanently censored.
-c2p_cache_separate_target_tag_port 1
-c2p_cache_max_candidate_probes 0
-c2p_cache_adaptive_probe_policy 1
-c2p_cache_adaptive_probe_score_threshold 4
-c2p_cache_adaptive_probe_explore_period 64
